+//! `NSOperation`, `NSBlockOperation`, `NSInvocationOperation`,
+//! `NSOperationQueue`.
+//!
+//! Minimal implementation: operations run synchronously on the calling
+//! thread. This is sufficient for games/SDKs that use operation queues for
+//! background housekeeping (analytics, update checks).
+
+use crate::abi::GuestFunction;
+use crate::mem::{ConstPtr, Mem};
